              "code": "a",
              "content": "Railway map of New South Wales showing the boundaries of the colonies, the names and boundaries of the counties are shown in blue, main and minor roads, railways open for traffic and railways under construction. Also shown are rivers, lakes, creeks, and towns. Relief shown by hachures and spot heights for major towns on railway lines."
